{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて、昨日は七夕でしたね！\n織姫と彦星さんが会えるめでたい日でしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほぼ、四年に一度しか晴れないと言われてるのですが、昼前かな！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨降ってなかったねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めでたいめでたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはなにかお願い事はしたかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやもお願い事したよ！\n大好きな皆さん........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで、かなうよー！\n全国握手会！ありましたねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方〜どうでしたかー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかてか！昨日はものすごい人の数でしたねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビックリです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の曲を披露させていただきましたが..............."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも支えてくださる、大事なファンの皆様に、ありがとうの気持ちを込めて、\nサプライズということで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月22日発売の新曲！\n走れBicycle\nを歌わせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーでしたかー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくいい曲でしょー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏らしくて、衣装もキラキラで可愛くて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これなかった方は......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またのきかいをお待ちしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く会いに来てねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はいい経験でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の人と握手することで、\n沢山のことが勉強出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方から！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★全握は、推しじゃなくても、握手することで、そのひとのよさを知れた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★毎回blog見てるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★いつもパワーもらってるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか！いってくださって、沢山のパワーを皆様からもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやももっともっとパワーをあたえれるような、ありがとーって感謝されるような、そんな素敵な人になりたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の恩返しをしたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてねぇ、リハーサル中にねぇ、\nななせまるがねぇー\n『何番、和田、まあや、』\nって言ってきて、\n『なに？笑』\nって聞いたら\n『なんか野球の放送のまね！笑』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っとかいってニヤニヤしながら言ってきた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとにかわいーぜっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんのしぐさはほんとに女の子らしくて、女の子でもドキドキしちゃうくらい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへっ！\nこれからもよろしくっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0001.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}